<title>UK: CRICKET-KENT V SURREY BENSON AND HEDGES CUP FINAL SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-KENT V SURREY BENSON AND HEDGES CUP FINAL SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the final of the</p>
<p>Benson and Hedges Cup (50 overs) between Kent and Surrey at</p>
<p>Lord's on Saturday:</p>
<p>Kent</p>
<p> M.Fleming lbw b Lewis	    7</p>
<p> M.Walker b Bicknell		6</p>
