<p> Extras (b-1 lb-7 w-17 nb-2)   27</p>
<p> Total (for nine wickets)     212 - innings closed</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-15 2-15 3-23 4-68 5-106 6-135 7-170 8-194</p>
<p>9-198</p>
